<title>UK: Fine Art Developments to demerge card unit.</title>
<headline>Fine Art Developments to demerge card unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Fine Art Developments Plc, posting a sharp drop in annual profits, said on Friday it had decided to demerge its card and paper products division.</p>
<p>The company said it hoped to give further details of the demerger before it reported interim results.</p>
